          "date": "2026-11-15 20:59:14.000000000",
          "tz": 0
        },
        "subject": "LU-20076 tests: let sanity 79 wait for the MDT statfs cache",
        "message": "LU-20076 tests: let sanity 79 wait for the MDT statfs cache\n\nsanity test_79 compares df, which the MDT sums from its cached OST\nstatfs, with the OSC statfs on the client. The MDT refreshes that\ncache about every 5 seconds, so after the space or grant on an OST\nchanges, df can lag the OSCs by that long. The ZFS sleeps in\nwait_delete_completed() used to cover the lag; now that it forces\na TXG commit instead, test_79 can compare the two inside it and\nfails with \"df avail mismatch OST avail\".\n\nRetry the comparison for up to 10 seconds before failing.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial testlist=sanity fstype=zfs\nFixes: e5911ebb158d (\"LU-20076 tests: force a TXG instead of sleeping on ZFS\")\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-opus-5-5\nSigned-off-by: Patrick Farrell <patrick@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: I356f81e2b6f871448f0f932b689ae402f3b515ac\nReviewed-on: https://review.whamcloud.com/c/fs/lustre-release/+/70557\nTested-by: Maloo <maloo@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: Andreas Dilger <adilger@thelustrecollective.com>\nTested-by: jenkins <devops@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: Oleg Drokin <green@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: Alex Deiter <adeiter@ddn.com>\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
  },
